    "display_name": "Screen Time",
    "long_instructions": "You are designing a survey to collect data about the impact of screen time on academic performance.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Come up with three or four questions you would ask to determine a student’s academic performance and their screen time. Once you’ve thought of your questions, discuss them with the AI.\r\n- Discuss with your AI ways to improve the questions. Based on the discussion, come up with a revised set of questions.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Design a survey to collect data about the impact of screen time on academic performance.",
